  "summary": "Virgo horoscope for July 27, 2026: focus on sharing rather than accumulating, giving back to caregivers or yourself, and taking midweek rest. Practice grounding, connect with nature, and ask your guides for support. You are ready to move out of survival mode; surrendering while acting honestly will help your intentions bring rewards. Cosmic tip: Ask for support when you need it.",
  "content": "Author: Snehaa Khanna Sahgal\n\nYou know true abundance lies in the way you share, not in how much you accumulate. Virgo, this wisdom is your core theme this week. You may find yourself giving back to your childhood, your caretakers or simply yourself in the ways you once needed. Yes, by midweek you may also want to put your feet up and rest but, truly, you are ready for this. Practise grounding, connect with nature and ask your angels and guides to support you in the ways you need. You are ready to move out of survival mode and into a phase where the moment you surrender, your heartfelt intentions and honest actions begin to reap rewards in your favour.\n\nCosmic tip: Ask for support when you need it.\n\nAries July 27, 2026\n\nTaurus July 27, 2026\n\nGemini July 27, 2026\n\nCancer July 27, 2026\n\nLeo July 27, 2026\n\nLibra July 27, 2026\n\nScorpio July 27, 2026\n\nSagittarius July 27, 2026\n\nCapricorn July 27, 2026\n\nAquarius July 27, 2026\n\nPisces July 27, 2026\n\nSee more stories\n\nCond\u00e9 Nast India\n\n\u00a9 2026 Cond\u00e9 Nast. All rights reserved. Use of this website constitutes acceptance of our Terms of Service and Policy and Cookie Statement. The material on this site may not be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, cached or otherwise used, except with the prior written permission of Cond\u00e9 Nast.",
